POST {{host}}/api/programas/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_asignatura": 4, "semestre": 3 }

### RB-05 semestre no positivo  → 400
POST {{host}}/api/programas/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_asignatura": 8, "semestre": 0 }

### ===================== ASIGNATURAS Y PRERREQUISITOS (RF-04, RF-12) =====================

### Crear asignatura nueva  → 201
POST {{host}}/api/asignaturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "sis301", "nombre": "Ingeniería de Software", "creditos": 3 }

> {% client.global.set("idSis301", response.body.id_asignatura); %}

### Incluirla en el plan de Sistemas, semestre 5  → 201
POST {{host}}/api/programas/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_asignatura": {{idSis301}}, "semestre": 5, "obligatoria": true }

### Código de asignatura repetido  → 409
POST {{host}}/api/asignaturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "BD101", "nombre": "Otra", "creditos": 3 }

### S-04 créditos en cero  → 400
POST {{host}}/api/asignaturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "SIS999", "nombre": "Prueba", "creditos": 0 }

### RB-13 prerrequisito de sí misma  → 422
POST {{host}}/api/asignaturas/4/prerrequisitos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_asignatura_requerida": 4 }

### RB-13 ciclo: PRG101 requeriría BD102 (BD102 -> BD101 -> PRG101)  → 422
POST {{host}}/api/asignaturas/2/prerrequisitos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_asignatura_requerida": 5 }

### Prerrequisitos de BD102  → 200
GET {{host}}/api/asignaturas/5/prerrequisitos

### =========================== PERIODOS (RF-06) ===========================

